<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγ-γνωστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
			Sch.<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Tr.</u>
			727
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pardonable,
				allowable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				435
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				981
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				418
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγνωστόν</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγνωστά ἐστι</span>, c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				352
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				139
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Med.</u>
				491
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				703
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1039
			</span></i>: c. part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῖς
				συγγνωστὰ πλάττουσιν . . </span><i>they may be forgiven
				for . . </i>, v.l.in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1083f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῆς φιλοτιμίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.8.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				4.3
			</span></i>: c.part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
				ἐπικλασθείς</span>
			<i>for</i> being . ., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>DDeor.</u>
					6.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
